{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-width section with a warm off-white background. The section should have a compact, elegant and editorial appearance.
    Inside the section, create one centered horizontal container with two columns placed close together. Do not create a full-width 50/50 split. The image and text should behave as one centered composition.
    LEFT COLUMN — IMAGE
    Add an editable image picker for an illustration.
    Display the image proportionally using object-fit: contain. Never crop or distort the image.
    Add an editable range control in the Shopify Theme Editor for the image width/size.
    RIGHT COLUMN — CONTENT
    Add:
    editable heading
    editable paragraph
    editable button label
    editable button link
    Center-align the content by default.
    The heading should read “PERSONAL SHOPPER”.
    The paragraph should appear directly below the heading, followed by an outlined rectangular button reading “ENTRE EM CONTATO”.
    Vertically center the image and the entire text block with each other.
    Keep approximately 50–70px of horizontal space between the illustration and text by default.
    SECTION SIZE & SPACING CONTROLS
    Add editable controls in the Shopify Theme Editor for:
    section height or minimum height
    section maximum content width
    top padding
    bottom padding
    left and right padding
    horizontal gap between image and text
    background color
    The merchant must be able to make the entire section taller or shorter directly from the Theme Editor without editing code.
    The image must not automatically increase the section height. It should scale proportionally to fit within the selected section dimensions.
    TYPOGRAPHY CONTROLS
    Add independent typography controls for the heading, paragraph and button.
    For the heading, provide editable settings for:
    font family
    font size
    font weight
    letter spacing
    line height
    text color
    uppercase / normal text transform
    For the paragraph, provide editable settings for:
    font family
    font size
    font weight
    letter spacing
    line height
    text color
    maximum text width
    For the button, provide editable settings for:
    font family
    font size
    font weight
    letter spacing
    text color
    border color
    border thickness
    button width
    button height
    horizontal padding
    vertical padding
    Do not force the heading, paragraph and button to use the same typography. They must be independently customizable.
    Whenever possible, allow the font-family controls to use fonts already available in the Shopify theme.
    LAYOUT CONTROLS
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    image width
    text column width
    gap between image and text
    content alignment
    vertical alignment
    overall content width
    Keep the default desktop composition centered on the page rather than stretched across the full screen.
    DESKTOP
    Display the illustration on the left and text on the right.
    Keep the entire composition centered horizontally and vertically inside the section.
    The illustration should be slightly taller than the complete text block.
    Do not use a 50/50 full-width column layout.
    MOBILE
    Stack the illustration above the text and center everything.
    Add separate mobile controls for:
    image width
    heading font size
    paragraph font size
    button font size
    top padding
    bottom padding
    spacing between image and text
    Make sure desktop customization does not create oversized elements on mobile.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-personal-shopper-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.section_min_height }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.vertical_alignment }};
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.horizontal_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.image_width }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 300px;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-text-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.text_column_width }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.content_alignment }};
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.content_alignment }};
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    {% if block.settings.heading_text_transform == 'uppercase' %}
      text-transform: uppercase;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-paragraph-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.paragraph_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.paragraph_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.paragraph_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.paragraph_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.paragraph_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.paragraph_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.paragraph_color }};
    margin: 0;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.paragraph_max_width }}px;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    background-color: transparent;
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.button_width }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.button_height }}px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-personal-shopper-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-personal-shopper-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .ai-personal-shopper-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-personal-shopper-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_width }}%;
    }

    .ai-personal-shopper-text-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ai-personal-shopper-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_font_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-personal-shopper-paragraph-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_paragraph_font_size }}px;
    }

    .ai-personal-shopper-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_font_size }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-personal-shopper-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-personal-shopper-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-personal-shopper-image-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
          class="ai-personal-shopper-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-personal-shopper-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-personal-shopper-text-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-personal-shopper-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.paragraph != blank %}
        <p class="ai-personal-shopper-paragraph-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.paragraph }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.button_label != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
          class="ai-personal-shopper-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.button_label }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

